ext-to-speech module  \n- 🔄 **Voice Changer**: Voice transformation  \n- 📺 **TTS SRT**: Subtitle-compatible TTS output  \n\nThese nodes are now **engine-agnostic**, meaning you can plug in **Chatterbox**, **F5**, or future engines seamlessly.\n"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":133,"type":"UnifiedTTSSRTNode","pos":[-1243.004150390625,1768.7225341796875],"size":[404.7402648925781,545.216796875],"flags":{},"order":18,"mode":4,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"TTS_engine","name":"TTS_engine","type":"TTS_ENGINE","link":230},{"localized_name":"opt_narrator","name":"opt_narrator","shape":7,"type":"*","link":null},{"localized_name":"srt_content","name":"srt_content","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"srt_content"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"narrator_voice","name":"narrator_voice","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"narrator_voice"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"seed","name":"seed","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"seed"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"timing_mode","name":"timing_mode","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"timing_mode"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"enable_audio_cache","name":"enable_audio_cache","shape":7,"type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"enable_audio_cache"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"fade_for_StretchToFit","name":"fade_for_StretchToFit","shape":7,"type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"fade_for_StretchToFit"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"max_stretch_ratio","name":"max_stretch_ratio","shape":7,"type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"max_stretch_ratio"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"min_stretch_ratio","name":"min_stretch_ratio","shape":7,"type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"min_stretch_ratio"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"timing_tolerance","name":"timing_tolerance","shape":7,"type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"timing_tolerance"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"batch_size","name":"batch_size","shape":7,"type":"INT","widget":{"name":"batch_size"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"use_native_duration_targeting","name":"use_native_duration_targeting","shape":7,"type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"use_native_duration_targeting"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"audio","name":"audio","type":"AUDIO","links":[231]},{"localized_name":"generation_info","name":"generation_info","type":"STRING","links":[232]},{"localized_name":"timing_report","name":"timing_report","type":"STRING","links":null},{"localized_name":"Adjusted_SRT","name":"Adjusted_SRT","type":"STRING","links":null}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"UnifiedTTSSRTNode","cnr_id":"chatterbox_srt_voice","ver":"5e4c39b3d25a437f83dd71cf21b2fad282eda9e1"},"widgets_values":["1\n00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,000\nHello! This is unified SRT TTS with character switching.\n\n2\n00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:09,500\n[Alice:crestfallen_original] Hi there! I'm Alice speaking with precise timing.\n\n3\n00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,000\n[Bob:crestfallen_original] And I'm Bob! The audio matches these exact SRT timings.","voices_examples/Clint_Eastwood CC3 (enhanced2).wav",2519695028,"fixed","smart_natural",true,0.01,1,0.5,2,0,false],"color":"#223","bgcolor":"#335"},{"id":115,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-3089.947265625,1001.278564453125],"size":[461.39898681640625,450.9547119140625],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{},"widgets_values":["# IndexTTS-2 情感控制指南\n\nIndexTTS-2 具备高级情感控制能力，可以让你精确控制生成语音的情感表达。本指南涵盖所有可用的情感控制方式及其应用。\n\n## 总览\n\nIndexTTS-2 支持多种情感控制方式，可组合使用以实现细腻的情感表达：\n\n- **直接音频参考**：用任意音频文件作为情感参考\n- **角色语音**：使用「🎭 角色语音」节点里的角色音频作为参考\n- **情感向量**：手动调节 8 个情感滑杆，精确控制数值\n- **文本情感**：由 AI（QwenEmotion）根据文字描述自动分析情感，支持动态模板\n- **角色标签情感**：用 `[角色:情感参考]` 语法按角色单独控制情感\n\n## 情感控制优先级\n\n引擎节点的 `emotion_control` 输入同一时间只能接一个来源：音频、文本或向量，三选一。\n\n当在文本里使用标签时，角色标签情感优先级最高——`[Alice:angry_bob]` 会覆盖该角色片段的所有其他情感设置。\n\n---\n\n## 方法 1：直接音频参考\n\n把任意音频文件直接接到 IndexTTS-2 引擎的 `emotion_control` 输入。\n\n**原理：**\n- IndexTTS-2 分析参考音频的情感特征\n- 该情感风格应用到所有生成的语音\n- 支持任意音频格式（WAV、MP3 等）\n\n**最佳实践：**\n- 使用情感表达清晰的音频片段\n- 选择音色一致的音频效果最好\n- 避免背景音乐或噪音\n\n**示例：**\n音频节点 → IndexTTS-2 引擎 (emotion_control)\n\ntext\n\n---\n\n## 方法 2：角色语音音频参考\n\n用「🎭 角色语音」节点的 `opt_narrator` 输出作为情感参考。\n\n**设置步骤：**\n1. 添加一个 🎭 角色语音节点\n2. 选择带有期望情感表达的语音\n3. 把 `opt_narrator` 输出接到 IndexTTS-2 引擎的 `emotion_control` 输入\n\n**优点：**\n- 复用你现有的语音库\n- 角色情感风格一致\n- 易于管理和组织\n\n**示例：**\n🎭 角色语音 (David_Attenborough) → opt_narrator → IndexTTS-2 引擎 (emotion_control)\n\ntext\n\n---\n\n## 方法 3：情感向量\n\n用「🌈 IndexTTS-2 情感向量」节点手动精确控制 8 种情感。\n\n**可用情感：**\n- **开心**：喜悦、兴奋、积极（0.0-1.2）\n- **愤怒**：攻击性、沮丧、强烈（0.0-1.2）\n- **悲伤**：忧郁、哀愁、低沉（0.0-1.2）\n- **惊讶**：惊叹、震惊、好奇（0.0-1.2）\n- **恐惧**：害怕、焦虑、紧张（0.0-1.2）\n- **厌恶**：反感、不悦、排斥（0.0-1.2）\n- **平静**：平和、放松、稳定（0.0-1.2）\n- **忧郁**：沉思的悲伤、惆怅（0.0-1.2）\n\n**使用技巧：**\n- 数值超过 1.0 会让情感更强烈，但可能影响克隆音色的相似度\n- 组合多种情感表达复杂情绪（如 0.8 开心 + 0.3 惊讶 = 兴奋的喜悦）\n- 先从单一情感开始，再尝试组合\n- 点 random 按钮可随机生成情感组合（可能过强）\n\n---\n\n## 方法 4：文本情感（动态分析）\n\n用「🌈 IndexTTS-2 文本情感」节点进行 AI 情感分析，支持动态模板。\n\n### 静态文本情感\n\n提供一句简单的情感描述，应用到所有文本片段：\n\n- 输入：`\"angry and frustrated\"`（愤怒且沮丧）\n- 结果：所有语音都带愤怒、沮丧的情感\n\n### 用 `{seg}` 做动态模板\n\n用 `{seg}` 占位符实现按片段上下文的情感分析：\n\n**模板示例：**\n\"Happy character speaking: {seg}\" — 欢快的角色旁白\n\"Angry boss yelling: {seg}\" — 愤怒的老板在吼（强势权威）\n\"Calm meditation guide: {seg}\" — 平静的冥想导师\n\"Excited game show host: {seg}\" — 兴奋的综艺主持人\n\ntext\n\n**动态模板原理：**\n- IndexTTS-2 逐个处理每个文本片段\n- `{seg}` 会被替换成实际的片段文本\n- QwenEmotion 分析「上下文 + 内容」的组合\n- 每个片段生成独立的情感向量\n\n**示例：**\n- 模板：`\"Worried parent speaking: {seg}\"`（担忧的父母在说话）\n- 片段：`\"Where have you been?\"`（你去哪了？）\n- 分析：`\"Worried parent speaking: Where have you been?\"`\n- 结果：焦虑、关切的语音表达\n\n---\n\n## 角色标签情感控制\n\n用文本里的内联标签按角色控制情感：`[角色:情感参考]`\n\n**语法：**\n[角色名:情感参考]\n\ntext\n\n**情感参考可选：**\n- 你语音库里的任意角色名（用该角色的语音作为情感）\n- 自定义情感参考\n\n**示例：**\nHello everyone! [Alice:happy_sarah] I'm so excited to be here today!\n[Bob:angry_tom] That's completely unacceptable behavior.\n[Narrator:David] Meanwhile, in a distant galaxy...\n\ntext\n*假设 happy_sarah、angry_tom 和 David 是你文件夹里已存在的别名或角色语音*\n\n**角色标签优先级：**\n- 角色标签会覆盖该角色所有其他情感设置\n- 其他角色仍使用全局情感设置\n- 允许在同一段音频里混合不同情感\n\n---\n\n## 情感强度控制（emotion_alpha）\n\nIndexTTS-2 引擎的 `emotion_alpha` 参数控制情感应用的强度：\n\n**数值含义：**\n- `0.0`：不应用情感（中性声音）\n- `0.5`：50% 情感混合（微妙的情感影响）\n- `1.0`：完整情感强度（标准推荐设置）\n- `1.5`：150% 增强情感（更戏剧化）\n- `2.0`：最大情感强度（非常戏剧化）\n\n---\n\n## 实际工作流示例\n\n### 示例 1：多角色戏剧 + 各自情感\n[Alice:happy_sarah] Welcome to our cooking show!\n[Bob:serious_narrator] Today we'll be making pasta.\n[Alice:excited_sarah] I can't wait to get started!\n\ntext\n\n**设置：**\n- 不需要全局情感控制\n- 每个角色通过标签获得独立情感\n- `emotion_alpha=1.0` 增强表现力\n\n### 示例 2：混合情感控制\n\n**全局设置：**\n- 🌈 文本情感：`\"Cheerful host presenting: {seg}\"`（欢快的主持人在介绍）\n- `emotion_alpha=0.8`\n\n**带覆盖的文本：**\nWelcome to our show! [Bob:serious_narrator] But first, a serious announcement.\n[Alice:excited_sarah] Now back to our regular programming!\n\ntext\n\n**结果：**\n- 默认片段使用欢快主持人的情感\n- Bob 的台词用严肃旁白的情感（覆盖全局）\n- Alice 的台词用兴奋情感（覆盖全局）\n\n---\n\n这套全面的情感控制系统，能让你在创作 TTS 音频时获得前所未有的灵活性，做出富有表现力、情感丰富的语音。\n"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":124,"type":"QwenEmotionNode","pos":[-2611.97314453125,1681.879638671875],"size":[400,200],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"qwen_model","name":"qwen_model","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"qwen_model"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"emotion_text","name":"emotion_text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"emotion_text"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"emotion_control","name":"emotion_control","type":"EMOTION_CONTROL","links":[220]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"QwenEmotionNode","cnr_id":"chatterbox_srt_voice","ver":"5e4c39b3d25a437f83dd71cf21b2fad282eda9e1"},"widgets_values":["qwen0.6bemo4-merge","Happy character speaking: {seg}"],"color":"#323","bgcolor":"#535"},{"id":82,"type":"PrimitiveStringMultiline","pos":[-2610.144775390625,722.1431274414062],"size":[659.7203369140625,226.72232055664062],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"值","name":"value","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"value"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"字符串","name":"STRING","type":"STRING","links":[183]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"PrimitiveStringMultiline","cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.3.40","widget_ue_connectable":{}},"widgets_values":["On Tuesdays, the pigeons held parliament.\n[Alice:crestfallen_original] They debated the ethics of breadcrumbs and the metaphysics of flight. \n[Bob:Alice] One particularly philosophical pigeon named Thistle believed gravity was just a suggestion.\n[Cowboy:crestfallen_original] He once floated for three minutes straight, fueled by sheer conviction and a gust of rebellious wind."],"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":129,"type":"Reroute","pos":[-2032.5596923828125,1235.5533447265625],"size":[75,26],"flags":{},"order":14,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"","type":"*","link":222}],"outputs":[{"name":"","type":"AUDIO","links":[]}],"properties":{"showOutputText":false,"horizontal":false},"color":"#323","bgcolor":"#535"},{"id":56,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-1470,1480],"size":[350,140],"flags":{},"order":4,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{},"widgets_values":["# 🎭  **Reference Audio Tips**\n\n1- You can connect any audio from a **Load Audio Core** node directly for **zero-shot voice cloning**\n \n2- or use the **🎭 Character Voices** feature to load a narrator from your `Voices` folder."],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":125,"type":"IndexTTSEmotionOptionsNode","pos":[-2558.6396484375,1048.947998046875],"size":[340,580],"flags":{},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"Happy","name":"Happy","shape":7,"type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"Happy"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"Angry","name":"Angry","shape":7,"type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"Angry"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"Sad","name":"Sad","shape":7,"type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"Sad"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"Surprised","name":"Surprised","shape":7,"type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"Surprised"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"Afraid","name":"Afraid","shape":7,"type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"Afraid"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"Disgusted","name":"Disgusted","shape":7,"type":"